### Monsterbox Maple server endpoints
### Edit @host below to match the device's IP (see boot log / Resolver.Log output for "WiFi connected. IP: ...")
@host = 192.168.1.102:5417

### Play sound file 1 (returns immediately; plays after the current track ends, replacing any already-pending sound)
POST http://{{host}}/sound?filenumber=1

### Play sound file 3
POST http://{{host}}/sound?filenumber=3

### Shake with default configuration (25-50 iterations, 50-75ms delay)
### Responds when the shake finishes (200), or immediately with 409 if a shake is already running
POST http://{{host}}/shake

### Shake with a short, gentle run
POST http://{{host}}/shake?bi=5&ei=10&bd=100&ed=150

### Shake with a long, aggressive run
POST http://{{host}}/shake?bi=40&ei=50&bd=25&ed=40
